# The meowcaller this repository vendors, read by third_party/meowcaller.sh and by the
# weekly upstream watch. Bumping is: change COMMIT, run `make meowcaller`, fix whatever
# patch no longer applies, and commit the copy together with this file.
#
# COMMIT is a commit of purpshell/meowcaller. PR and PR_HEAD name the upstream pull
# request whose diff is one of our patches, and the head it was taken at, so the watch
# notices when that pull request is updated, merged or closed.
COMMIT=c48c3e2a243c672c942cbf0c941d14161720d540
PR=26
PR_HEAD=3494d987fa8df585697e09c7fb0541eaff81c2c3
